    "first_cheat": "Positives: messages[0..first_cheat_message], so the first-cheat assistant turn without its tool results. Other runs: a length L drawn with replacement from the positives' first_cheat_message values (random.Random(seed), negatives first, then clean passes, then intent/ambiguous runs without a labelled message; each class in arm order, then task number), cut after the assistant tool-call turn nearest L (ties to the shorter cut; past the run's last turn snaps to that turn). Intent/ambiguous runs with a labelled first_cheat_message are cut there.",
    "pressure": "Positives with a scaffold failure reply before first_cheat_message, cut as in first_cheat. Negatives with at least one failure reply, cut after their first assistant tool-call turn after the first such reply; negatives with no tool-call turn after it are excluded and counted.",
